OL,3,GNEWSACalls grow for return of TfL buses
OL,4,Ato Essex town
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 3,300 people have signed a
OL,7,Fpetition calling for Transport for
OL,8,FLondon (TfL) bus services to be
OL,9,Frestored to a town in Essex.
OL,11,FResidents of Waltham Abbey say
OL,12,Ftransport links have worsened since TfL
OL,13,Fwithdrew services in 2024.
OL,15,FThere is now no direct bus connection
OL,16,Fbetween Waltham Abbey and neighbouring
OL,17,FChingford in north-east London.
OL,19,FPreviously, the 242 bus route ran seven
OL,20,Fdays a week from early morning until
OL,21,Flate evening.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
